    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>A former Department of Defense investigator Embraced by Gino Manitelli, Karina Dobson is Marcus Vitel's chief intelligence gatherer, expert in surveillance tradecraft and database infiltration. Her greatest coup was locating and Blood Binding an entire Delta Force team into ghouls, a private strike force capable of annihilating threats from rogue Garou to Sabbat incursions. Fanatically loyal even beyond her Blood Bond, she keeps her considerable resources deliberately obscure.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>You always seem pleased, as though you have a secret no one can guess. You feed only from military personnel, frequenting the Pentagon and Bethesda Naval Hospital.</p>",
    "notes": "Sire: Gino Manitelli. Disciplines (as printed): Dominate 3, Fortitude 1, Presence 1. Blood Bound to Prince Marcus Vitel. Haven: unknown/mobile. Secrets: unlisted (high). Convert Disciplines by adding owned power Items from the disciplines compendium at Storyteller discretion.",
    "npcType": "vampire"
